{
    "title": "Dancefitme: Fun Workouts",
    "description": "DanceFitme provides <b>energetic dance workouts</b> and cardios for <b>weight loss</b> everywhere! Get motivated with hiphop inspired fitness, cardio and 4-week workout plans. Get fit and have fun with dancefitme which contains workouts from beginner to advanced.\r\n\r\nWITH DanecFitme YOU\u2019LL GET\r\n-Get an exclusive 28-day personalized dance program\r\n-Connect your dance workouts directly to your TV Experience\r\n-hiphop, aerobics, jazz, Latin, hip-hop, high heels, and other dance classes make exercising simple and fun\r\n-Become slim, sexy, and happy all in one app.\r\n\r\n<b>Dance Workouts Styles include: </b>\r\n>>Aerobics\r\n>>Cardio\r\n>>Hiphop \r\n>>Salsa\r\n>>K-pop\r\n>>Open style\r\n>>Latin\r\n\r\n<b>Start moving your body by downloading the DanceFitme app.</b>\r\n- Dance workouts app for weight loss\r\n- Numerous of beginner dance workouts for Choosing Freely\r\n- Professional dancer team creates dance workout\r\n- Break a sweat with dance workouts at home \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fDanceFitme provides a fashionable and efficient way to lose weight in 2024. As DanceFitme know the traditional workout is boring and hard to commit to, you can say goodbye to boring routines and follow us at DanceFitme to lose weight efficiently and joyfully.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fDanceFitme took 6 months to develop program with the right intensity, music, dance styles, and movements aimed at weight loss and burning calories. Whether you have danced before, DanceFitme will help you lose weight in a more energetic and efficient way. Let's learn dance at home from teachers from the professional dance school. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fFollow the music DanceFitme selected and move your body with the dance bit, just in a song you can burn 100 calories while having fun with the pumped-up tunes and energetic moves. All of above can make weight loss exciting.\r\n\r\n<h2>5 MAJOR BENEFITS YOU GET:</h2>\r\n<b>-POPULAR QUICK WEIGHT LOSS DANCE STYLES:</b>\r\nhip-hop, Salsa, Latin, Aerobics, K-hop, pop, aerobics, and our specially designed fitness & dance class. Over 100+ songs and programs in the DanceFitme app.\r\n\r\n<b>-PERSONALIZED DANCE WORKOUTS PLAN</b>\r\nDanceFitme tailor your dance workout plan according to your current body status, weight loss goals, and the areas where you want to improve. We'll generate a dance workout plan for you and in 4 weeks you can follow the routine and feel the joy of dance. With just 4 week's dance workout plan, you are more likely to keep on track. \r\n\r\n<b>-FOR ANY LEVEL</b>\r\nWhether you're a newbie or a pro, you will find a suitable program or dance workouts in this Dance app with our simple and easy instructions. Remember, everyone will be at a different level, the great thing is that you are working out!\r\n\r\n<b>-FOR ALL BODY PARTS</b>\r\nDance workouts are designed by fitness and dance experts to help you achieve your goals. You can select the total body, or specific parts such as abs, back, or legs, which makes your practice more targeted.\r\n\r\n<b>- AUTOMATED DATA TRACKER</b>\r\nTrack your progress to motivate yourself and reach new fitness goals. You can view calories burned and practice data in DanceFitme. Progress Tracking to motivate yourself and reach new dance fitness levels and get that dream body! Keep fit and see the progress!\r\n\r\n\r\n* All payments will be paid through your Google Account and may be managed under Account Settings after the initial payment. Subscription payments will automatically renew unless deactivated at least 24 hours before the end of the current cycle. Your account will be charged for renewal at least 24 hours before the end of the current cycle. Any unused portion of your free trial will be forfeited upon payment. Cancellations are incurred by disabling auto-renewal.\r\n\r\nCONTACT & INFO Email: support@dancefit.me\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.dancefit.me/privacy-policy.html\r\nTerms of Use Agreement: https://www.dancefit.me/terms-of-use.html\r\nFOLLOW US\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Dance-Burn-103381852315808/",
    "descriptionHTML": "DanceFitme provides <b>energetic dance workouts</b> and cardios for <b>weight loss</b> everywhere! Get motivated with hiphop inspired fitness, cardio and 4-week workout plans. Get fit and have fun with dancefitme which contains workouts from beginner to advanced.<br><br>WITH DanecFitme YOU\u2019LL GET<br>-Get an exclusive 28-day personalized dance program<br>-Connect your dance workouts directly to your TV Experience<br>-hiphop, aerobics, jazz, Latin, hip-hop, high heels, and other dance classes make exercising simple and fun<br>-Become slim, sexy, and happy all in one app.<br><br><b>Dance Workouts Styles include: </b><br>&gt;&gt;Aerobics<br>&gt;&gt;Cardio<br>&gt;&gt;Hiphop <br>&gt;&gt;Salsa<br>&gt;&gt;K-pop<br>&gt;&gt;Open style<br>&gt;&gt;Latin<br><br><b>Start moving your body by downloading the DanceFitme app.</b><br>- Dance workouts app for weight loss<br>- Numerous of beginner dance workouts for Choosing Freely<br>- Professional dancer team creates dance workout<br>- Break a sweat with dance workouts at home <br><br>\ud83c\udf1fDanceFitme provides a fashionable and efficient way to lose weight in 2024. As DanceFitme know the traditional workout is boring and hard to commit to, you can say goodbye to boring routines and follow us at DanceFitme to lose weight efficiently and joyfully.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fDanceFitme took 6 months to develop program with the right intensity, music, dance styles, and movements aimed at weight loss and burning calories. Whether you have danced before, DanceFitme will help you lose weight in a more energetic and efficient way. Let&#39;s learn dance at home from teachers from the professional dance school. <br><br>\ud83c\udf1fFollow the music DanceFitme selected and move your body with the dance bit, just in a song you can burn 100 calories while having fun with the pumped-up tunes and energetic moves. All of above can make weight loss exciting.<br><br><h2>5 MAJOR BENEFITS YOU GET:</h2><br><b>-POPULAR QUICK WEIGHT LOSS DANCE STYLES:</b><br>hip-hop, Salsa, Latin, Aerobics, K-hop, pop, aerobics, and our specially designed fitness &amp; dance class. Over 100+ songs and programs in the DanceFitme app.<br><br><b>-PERSONALIZED DANCE WORKOUTS PLAN</b><br>DanceFitme tailor your dance workout plan according to your current body status, weight loss goals, and the areas where you want to improve. We&#39;ll generate a dance workout plan for you and in 4 weeks you can follow the routine and feel the joy of dance. With just 4 week&#39;s dance workout plan, you are more likely to keep on track. <br><br><b>-FOR ANY LEVEL</b><br>Whether you&#39;re a newbie or a pro, you will find a suitable program or dance workouts in this Dance app with our simple and easy instructions. Remember, everyone will be at a different level, the great thing is that you are working out!<br><br><b>-FOR ALL BODY PARTS</b><br>Dance workouts are designed by fitness and dance experts to help you achieve your goals. You can select the total body, or specific parts such as abs, back, or legs, which makes your practice more targeted.<br><br><b>- AUTOMATED DATA TRACKER</b><br>Track your progress to motivate yourself and reach new fitness goals. You can view calories burned and practice data in DanceFitme. Progress Tracking to motivate yourself and reach new dance fitness levels and get that dream body! Keep fit and see the progress!<br><br><br>* All payments will be paid through your Google Account and may be managed under Account Settings after the initial payment. Subscription payments will automatically renew unless deactivated at least 24 hours before the end of the current cycle. Your account will be charged for renewal at least 24 hours before the end of the current cycle. Any unused portion of your free trial will be forfeited upon payment. Cancellations are incurred by disabling auto-renewal.<br><br>CONTACT &amp; INFO Email: support@dancefit.me<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.dancefit.me/privacy-policy.html<br>Terms of Use Agreement: https://www.dancefit.me/terms-of-use.html<br>FOLLOW US<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Dance-Burn-103381852315808/",
